    "Sheets whose grid we know, for checking the reader in src/detect.rs.",
    "The packs are not in the repository, so a case whose file is missing is",
    "skipped rather than failed. Add a case whenever a sheet reads wrong.",
    "'kind' says what a sheet is: a grid of tiles, a strip of sprites, or a",
    "picture with no grid at all, where the numbers are only what was chosen.",
    "'expect' is what the reader does today. A case marked pass must keep",
    "passing. A case marked fail is a known weakness, and turning one into a",
    "pass is the work. The reader finds only the pitch so far, so a case is",
    "checked on tile plus gap, not on the two apart."
